.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-task-alive 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-task\-alive \- What tasks are running right now and what phase each is in — one call, no log reading
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten task alive\fR [\fB\-\-instant\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-program\-root\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
What tasks are running right now and what phase each is in — one call, no log reading
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-program\-root\fR
The directory this consumer keeps its task programs in, matched inside a live process\*(Aqs cmdline
.TP
\fB\-\-instant\fR
The epoch second to judge time\-dependent records against, supplied as data
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
